# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this file the working tree has no agreed ending, so `core.autocrlf` on
# a Windows checkout wants CRLF while Prettier, Bun, and CI all write LF. Git
# then reports files as modified that have no content difference, and the noise
# comes back every time any tool rewrites anything.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be normalised.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
